00:25:05.082 --> 00:25:06.540
In this, we're just
using a bucket,

00:25:06.540 --> 00:25:08.633
so that makes it simpler.

00:25:08.633 --> 00:25:09.550
So switch to the demo.

00:25:12.420 --> 00:25:14.660
So here in that
same load balancer--

00:25:14.660 --> 00:25:16.970
