Demo CDN lb 1.

00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:25.500
So here's my back end.

00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:27.290
And I don't have any
services attached.

00:25:27.290 --> 00:25:30.020
So let's create a back end
bucket, which is specifically

00:25:30.020 --> 00:25:31.510
a serving bucket.

00:25:31.510 --> 00:25:37.220
Now let's do demo
