00:25:51.620 --> 00:25:54.890
activate caching at the edge
when this service becomes

00:25:54.890 --> 00:25:57.136
live on the load balancer.

00:25:57.136 --> 00:25:59.026
That's it.

00:25:59.026 --> 00:25:59.526
Create.

00:26:02.880 --> 00:26:05.680
So switch to the slides.

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:06.600
Great.

00:26:06.600 --> 00:26:08.192
So we've stepped
through that part.

00:26:08.192 --> 00:26:10.650
We stepped through that part,
we stepped through that part.

00:26:10.650 --> 00:26:12.600
Back end mapping to a bucket.

00:26:12.600 --> 00:26:14.310
And we actually
activated caching.

